WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.333
Division and multiplication

2
00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:10.167
Twenty-four students split into teams for a game. Each team will have six students.

3
00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:13.800
We put the twenty-four students in groups of six.

4
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:17.433
That makes four teams.

5
00:00:17.433 --> 00:00:21.067
Twenty-four divided by six is four.

6
00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:25.000
That is because four times six is twenty-four.
